" The"," oxygen"," atoms"," in"," particular"," play"," an"," important"," role"," in"," the"," behavior"," of"," gold","/","metal"," oxide"," interfaces",","," because"," they"," may"," participate"," in"," catalytic"," reaction"," steps","."," Detailed"," information"," about"," the"," inter","facial"," structures"," between"," G","NPs"," and"," metal"," oxides"," provides"," valuable"," structure"," models"," for"," theoretical"," calculations"," which"," can"," elucidate"," the"," local"," electronic"," structure"," effective"," for"," activating"," a"," react","ant"," molecule","."," Based"," on"," our"," observations"," with"," H","RT","EM"," and"," HA","AD","F","-","STEM",","," we"," report"," the"," detailed"," structure"," of"," gold","/","metal"," oxide"," interfaces","."]}]